1252..1327 Comment "/// Put-get and put-put together. Put-put\'s continuation can be a `get`, so"
1328..1403 Comment "/// its inner `put` is a put-get redex; both reducts store the second value"
1404..1435 Comment "/// and continue at it (#2116)."
