1695..1769 Comment "/// Reading twice is reading once at the same state. The inner `get` is an"
1770..1840 Comment "/// instance of the rule\'s own left side through its pattern, and both"
1841..1910 Comment "/// reducts read once and continue at that state three times (#2116)."
